WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.332
A ba wã sẽn yaa rĩmã ra nonga a bi-pugl-kãsengã hal t'a ra pa rat n dɩk-a n kẽ kãadem ye.

00:00:06.412 --> 00:00:08.133
La wakat fãa ra loogdame.

00:00:08.213 --> 00:00:16.274
Sẽn na yɩl n kɩt t'a Yennenga bãng a sẽn dat n maan to-to wã, a bʋga okra pʋʋg a sẽn bas tɩ kʋɩlen wa a bi-bɩɩmã.
